# Governance reference docs are parsed line-by-line (offscript/src/playbook.ts).
# The parser is CRLF-tolerant, but we still pin these to LF so a Windows
# checkout with `core.autocrlf=true` keeps them byte-stable and never
# reintroduces the loader hazard. (v2: moved from references/ to resources/.)
offscript/resources/**/*.md text eol=lf
